From b3a49138a53ce58a7e7a494fb55d9d850aea0cf3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Govindarajulu Varadarajan <govindarajulu.varadarajan@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Oct 2025 20:11:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 141/190] xilinx-ai-engine: Use __fput_sync to destroy the
 partition

commit 7f2b2bc005da2abc29820d02e03bdd6589fb8af0 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

flush_delayed_fput() only flushes the async fputs added to delay queue.
__fput_sync() makes sure the fput() is handled and device is
unregistered before returning. No need for driver to wait for other FDs
to close. fput only current fd and return.

Signed-off-by: Govindarajulu Varadarajan <govindarajulu.varadarajan@amd.com>
Acked-by: Gregory Williams <gregory.williams@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20251003031202.2319372-2-govindarajulu.varadarajan@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-dev.c | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-dev.c b/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-dev.c
index 86b3becd22f9..1a70f08ca248 100644
--- a/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-dev.c
+++ b/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-dev.c
@@ -865,8 +865,7 @@ void aie_partition_release(struct device *dev)
 		return;
 
 	apart = dev_to_aiepart(dev);
-	fput(apart->filep);
-	flush_delayed_fput();
+	__fput_sync(apart->filep);
 }
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(aie_partition_release);
 
-- 
